The site endeavours to be inclusive rather than exclusive to Canadians by providing additional online space to all genres and formats[ of Canadian] moving pictures[,] and by supporting organizations from all corners of the country. Cinema[ Canadiana] aims to help give a voice to the independent filmmakers[ of our nation] by providing free online space for user-driven content, thus[ allowing] for a diversity of voices to emerge.[
]Beyond being a crowdsourced site with a user-driven experience that promotes Canadian content, Cinema[ Canadian]a’s design philosophy is two-fold. First, to utilize our website to drive users to other areas[ of the] Internet that highlight the content created around these projects (official sites, places[ to see] the work, reviews, interviews, etc.). Secondly, we will provide a forum to encourage dialogue in order to advance the knowledge and exchange of ideas, thus[ improving] the capacity to appreciate the works.
