Linc Gasking, who previously ran countingdown[.]com (which Dream[Works acquired]), and Eugene d’Eon, formerly of Weta[ Digital and] Nvidia, founded the startup in 2014.
To date,[ 8]i has raised $14.8 million in funding from investors[ including] RRE Ventures, Founders[ Fund] Science, Horizons Ventures, Samsung[ Ventures], Dolby Family Ventures, Signia Venture[ Partners], Bertelsmann Digital Media[ Investments], Sound[ Ventures,] Inevitable Ventures[,] Freelands[,] and Advancit[ Capital].
